    {
      "task_id": "feature_03",
      "instruction": "Feature:1. The product adopts all‑round waterproof and sealed design, IPX7 waterproof, convenient, durable and clean.2. U‑shaped toothbrush design, using soft food‑grade silicone material, safe, protect the child's delicate oral skin.3. 360‑degree contact with gums and teeth, every brushing can bring a quick and comfortable teeth cleaning experience to the mouth.4. Can effectively protect the gums, promote periodontal blood circulation, and reduce the occurrence of periodontal diseases.5. The two brush heads can be switched at will to meet different tooth brushing needs.Specification:Item Type: U-Shaped Automatic ToothbrushHost Power: 2WRated Charging Input: 5V/1ACharging Time: About 2 hoursLithium Battery: 450mAh (included)Instructions:Step 1: Insert the brush head carefully into the output shaft and fix it.Step 2: Squeeze the toothpaste into the toothbrush head. Liquid toothpaste or ordinary toothpaste can be used. Ordinary toothpaste must be wetted with braces before putting it in the mouthStep 3: Gently place the upper and lower teeth on the alveolar, then press the switch, shake the toothbrush left and right with your hands to touch the teeth on both sides.Step 4: Complete the tooth cleaning, clean the toothbrush, and dry it. Package List:1 x Main Machine 1 x U-Shaped Brush Head1 x Brush Head 1 x USB Charging Cable Note:When the product is not used for a long time or stored for a long time, it is recommended to charge and discharge once within three months",
      "query_mode": "text",
      "query_image": null,
      "query_image_sha256": null
    },
